# rel_split arguments that reproduce the golden split of test_mode.
# Both alignment-stub items are 4-byte so both .if 0 guards drop correctly.
# The .data function-pointer variable is handled by rewrite_dataref as
# .4byte _prolog + 0x1A0, same as a jump table -- no special handling.
#
# usage: python tools/rel_split.py test_mode $(grep -v "^#" tools/rel_split_args/test_mode.args)

